---
import WysShelf from '../../components/WysShelf.astro';
import WysPackage from '../../components/WysPackage.astro';
import WysStories from '../../components/WysStories.astro';
import WysFrame from '../../components/WysFrame.astro';
import WysHero from '../../components/WysHero.astro';
import WysFaq from '../../components/WysFaq.astro';
import BlueprintForm from '../../components/BlueprintForm.astro';
import {packages} from '../../data/wys-packages.js';
// Written for a buyer who knows nothing about affiliate marketing.
// Every claim comes from claude/WYS_FOUNDER_INTAKE.md and Jodie's stated
// decisions. No price, date or checkout on this page while the release hold
// is active; the launch list is the only action.
const plain = [
 ['You have an Amazon storefront.','It\'s your own page on Amazon, with lists of things you\'d actually recommend. Amazon Influencers get one.'],
 ['People shop from Pinterest and Google.','They search for things like "pink Halloween decor". A pin or a blog post that answers that search keeps showing up for months, not hours.'],
 ['Every pin leads back to your list.','Someone clicks, lands on your Amazon list and buys. That\'s how Amazon affiliate links work.'],
 ['The hard part is the content.','Photos, pins, captions and a blog post, over and over, forever. That\'s the part WYS does for you.'],
];
const makes = [
 ['01 / The basic photo','Your finds from one Amazon list, laid out together, with a headline on it.'],
 ['02 / The styled photo','The same finds fully styled in a real, lived-in room. Nothing bare, nothing beige.'],
 ['03 / The lifestyle photo','Your AI persona using them in real life, if you choose to have one.'],
 ['04 / Three Pinterest pins','One for each photo, with titles and descriptions written for Pinterest search.'],
 ['05 / An Instagram post','The three photos as a swipeable carousel, with the caption written.'],
 ['06 / A blog post','The look as an article on your website, so Google can find it too.'],
];
---
<WysFrame title="The While-You-Sleep Storefront™ | TDIE" description="Set it up once. It turns the finds on your Amazon storefront into photos, Pinterest pins, an Instagram post and a blog post, and schedules them for you." ogImage={packages[1].photos[1].src.src}>
 <WysHero><p class="wys-ribbon">The Digital Income Edit™ presents</p><h1>The While-You-Sleep<br/><em>Storefront™</em></h1><p class="wz-header-tagline">Planned. Pinned. Posted. Blogged. You slept.</p><p class="wys-lede">Set it up once. After that, it takes the finds on your Amazon storefront and turns them into photos, Pinterest pins, an Instagram post and a blog post, then schedules every one of them. You stop making content. Your storefront keeps working.</p><div class="wys-actions"><a class="wys-button" href="#launch-list">Join the launch list</a><a class="wys-button" href="#full-example">See a real example ↓</a></div></WysHero>

 <section class="wx-process-band"><div class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-centered"><p class="wys-label">New to all of this?</p><h2>Here's the whole idea,<br/>in plain English.</h2></div><div class="wx-process wx-four">{plain.map(([t,p])=><div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>

 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-centered"><p class="wys-label">What it makes for every look</p><h2>One look. Six pieces.<br/><em>All of them scheduled.</em></h2><p>A look is a handful of products from one of your Amazon lists, styled together: a pink Halloween coffee bar, a pumpkin patch outfit, a cozy reading corner.</p></div><div class="wx-process">{makes.map(([t,p])=><div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></div>)}</div><p class="wx-centered" style="margin-top:22px">Every pin links to the Amazon list its products came from.</p></section>

 <WysShelf/>
 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section" id="full-example"><WysPackage example={packages[0]} number={1} tour/></section>
 <WysStories/>

 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-paper-strip"><div><h2>What "automatic" really means.</h2><p><b>It's automatic by default.</b> Once it's set up, it runs on the schedule you choose. No making lists, no writing captions, no thinking about it.</p><p><b>Want to check things first?</b> Turn on approvals and nothing posts until you say yes. For your first few days, leave approvals on.</p><p><b>Keep your computer on.</b> Amazon lists are made in your browser, so your computer needs to be awake for that step.</p></div><div><h2>What you'll need.</h2><p><b>An Amazon Influencer storefront.</b> Your pins link to the lists on it.</p><p><b>Claude or ChatGPT</b> to run it.</p><p><b>Higgsfield</b> for the photos. Every photo uses credits, so you set a monthly budget and it stops when the budget is spent.</p><p><b>Metricool</b> to schedule your Pinterest and Instagram posts.</p><p><b>A website for the blog posts.</b> No website yet? The Weekend Ecosystem™ builds one in a weekend.</p><p>These tools have their own costs. WYS doesn't include them.</p></div></div></section>

 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-paths"><div><p class="wys-label">How you get it</p><h2>Not a PDF.<br/><em>A website.</em></h2><p>Every step, every prompt and every setting lives on one interactive website, and it's kept up to date when the tools change.</p></div><div class="wx-path-list"><div><b>Set up once</b><p>It asks about your style, your categories, how often to post and your budget, one question at a time.</p></div><div><b>Your look, not mine</b><p>Your style, your categories, your persona. Tommy Kate's pink farmhouse is just the example.</p></div><div><b>You decide how hands-off</b><p>Fully automatic, or approve every pin before it posts.</p></div><div><b>No gatekeeping</b><p>Every option at every step, including the cheaper ones.</p></div></div></div></section>

 <WysFaq/>

 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section" id="launch-list"><div class="wx-last-call"><p class="wys-label">Not on sale yet</p><h2>Be first<br/>when it opens.</h2><p>WYS is in final testing. Join the launch list and you'll hear the moment it opens.</p><BlueprintForm kit="wys-waitlist" file="" heading="" sub="" button="Put me on the list" doneTitle="You're on the list." doneSub="You'll hear the moment The While-You-Sleep Storefront™ opens." fine="Just the launch email. Unsubscribe anytime." /></div></section>
</WysFrame>
